gm-method (_*-gitignored worker import-graph file 404s on static host): a file matching a _*-gitignore pattern in a worker's import graph is excluded from git and 404s on a gh-pages or static deploy, breaking the worker silently. Audit every worker entry point's full import graph for gitignored files before deploying. The fix is either to un-gitignore the file, rename it to not match the pattern, or bundle it into the worker output so the 404 never reaches the browser.